 R←Test_Alias_011(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;ref;rc;msg;res;alias
⍝ Call ]Cider.OpenProject [?] with aliases defined, but select nothing from the list.
⍝ Used to report "No aliase defined" although there were aliases.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 alias←'test-alias-011'
 ##.Cider.AddAlias(∆ALIAS_TEMP_FOLDER,'/Project2')alias
 ref←∆GetRefToCommTools
 ref.AddAutomation'Select' 'SelecProject@'⍬

 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD'OpenProject [?] -watch=ns -batch -ignoreUserExec'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Cancelled by user'⍷res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ref.Cleanup
 {}##.Cider.DropAlias alias
⍝Done
